---
const rows = [
  {
    label: '승인',
    items: [
      { text: '결제 명령 메시지', kind: 'message' },
      { text: 'DB에 저장', kind: 'db' },
      { text: '대기열', kind: 'queue' },
      { text: '승인 워커', kind: 'worker' },
      { text: '외부 PG', kind: 'external' },
    ],
  },
  {
    label: '결과 발행',
    items: [
      { text: '승인 결과', kind: 'plain' },
      { text: 'DB에 저장', kind: 'db' },
      { text: '대기열', kind: 'queue' },
      { text: '결과 발행 워커', kind: 'worker' },
      { text: '승인 결과 메시지', kind: 'message' },
    ],
  },
];
---
<figure class="pt-queue-figure" aria-labelledby="pt-queue-title">
  <div class="figure-heading" id="pt-queue-title">PG 서비스 안에서 작업이 처리되는 순서</div>
  <div class="rows">
    {rows.map(row => (
      <section class="row" aria-label={`${row.label}: ${row.items.map(item => item.text).join(' → ')}`}>
        <span class="row-label">{row.label}</span>
        <ol class="items">
          {row.items.map(item => <li class={item.kind}>{item.text}</li>)}
        </ol>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="backup"><span class="db-chip">DB</span><span>서버가 멈춰 대기열이 사라져도, 폴링 워커가 몇 초마다 DB에 남은 작업을 찾아 다시 처리한다</span></p>
</figure>
<style>
  .pt-queue-figure { --worker: #6b5a9e; margin: 1.75rem 0; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); color: var(--sl-color-text); }
  :global([data-theme='dark']) .pt-queue-figure { --worker: #b9a8e6; }
  .pt-queue-figure :is(div, p, section, ol, li, i) { margin-block: 0; }
  .figure-heading { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .rows { display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 1rem !important; }
  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4.2rem 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .row-label { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .items { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem 1.3rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .items li { position: relative; padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem; font-size: 0.76rem; white-space: nowrap; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); }
  .items li:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; right: -1.05rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .items .worker { border-color: var(--worker); color: var(--sl-color-white); font-weight: 600; }
  .items .queue { border-style: dashed; }
  .items .external, .items .plain { background: transparent; border-style: dotted; }
  .backup { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.9rem !important; padding-top: 0.8rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-hairline); font-size: 0.76rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .db-chip { flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); font-size: 0.7rem; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
